### Try the API from VS Code (install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request").
### Start the API first:  uvicorn api.main:app --reload

### Is the service alive and the model loaded?
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Which model is deployed, and how did it do on the test set?
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/model-info

### Get a real example transaction (add ?fraud=true for a known fraud)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/sample?fraud=true

### Score one transaction: paste the JSON from /sample into the body
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict?threshold=0.5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Time": 406, "V1": -2.3122, "V2": 1.9519, "V3": -1.6096, "V4": 3.9979, "V5": -0.5222, "V6": -1.4265, "V7": -2.5374,
  "V8": 1.3917, "V9": -2.7701, "V10": -2.7723, "V11": 3.2020, "V12": -2.8999, "V13": -0.5952, "V14": -4.2893,
  "V15": 0.3897, "V16": -1.1407, "V17": -2.8301, "V18": -0.0168, "V19": 0.4170, "V20": 0.1269, "V21": 0.5172,
